            "review_title": "Review at Barbecue Garden",
            "review_text": "Valerio\nRome, Italy38 contributions\n0\nOptimal\nDec 2023 • Couples\nExcellent food, friendly, attentive and English-speaking staff, which is not a given in Vietnam. Super cheap. The best of those we tried during our three-day stay in Ho Chi Minh. You can cook the meat yourself on your own table. Delicious seafood noodles as well as the fried calamari.\nShow original\nWritten December 31, 2023",
